# Line endings.
#
# This repository stores LF, and every tool that touches it writes LF. One file
# was committed with CRLF and stayed the odd one out: each edit rewrote it
# wholesale, so a 39-line change appeared as 581 changed lines, and after it was
# "restored" the next edit churned it again. Declaring the convention stops that
# class of noise, and makes a whole-file diff mean a whole-file change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files that must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
